INTUITIVE JOINT EDITING AND ANGLED TIMBER CONSTRUCTION

The project currently has an accepted mobile fortress-construction, wisp-placement,
siege, reinforcement, targeting, presentation, and persistence foundation.

This task focuses exclusively on improving the central construction experience.

Do not add new projectiles, materials, levels, progression, monetization,
environmental mechanics, Bullseye variants, wind devices, or visual fortress
transformation.

PRODUCT GOAL

Fortress construction must feel quick, permissive, and intelligent.

The player should be able to create:

- Long timber spans
- Vertical posts
- Horizontal roofs
- Peaked roofs
- Angled rafters
- Diagonal braces
- T-shaped frames
- Triangular supports
- Enclosed wisp chambers

without fighting joint-management controls or requiring pixel-perfect placement.

The builder should infer ordinary structural intent while remaining predictable.

